{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201780/extras/690a3b21b09d2d8dbd3a0a48f6954417.poster.avif?t=1755109949\" width=616 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201780/extras/690a3b21b09d2d8dbd3a0a48f6954417.webm?t=1755109949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201780/extras/690a3b21b09d2d8dbd3a0a48f6954417.mp4?t=1755109949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Defeat everyone who stands in your way to eliminate Queen Nerissa of the vampiric kingdom Steam Veins, before her bite turns you into a servant of those demonic creatures.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201780/extras/61fc193557de83e27bc399ee54b4ad4c.avif?t=1755109949\" width=616 height=48 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201780/extras/17869e04a60cf7539750fc45768fe32e.poster.avif?t=1755109949\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201780/extras/17869e04a60cf7539750fc45768fe32e.webm?t=1755109949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201780/extras/17869e04a60cf7539750fc45768fe32e.mp4?t=1755109949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Buy drinks from the vending machines and gain great powers from the bosses when you defeat them. Before each battle, buy items from your sister Cassandra, who will be waiting for you just before each boss fight.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201780/extras/b993260569c551d74e32bd3d817cf865.avif?t=1755109949\" width=616 height=48 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201780/extras/7b95d014dcf77f12a6805f4b47ab554f.poster.avif?t=1755109949\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201780/extras/7b95d014dcf77f12a6805f4b47ab554f.webm?t=1755109949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201780/extras/7b95d014dcf77f12a6805f4b47ab554f.mp4?t=1755109949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Get your starting ticket from your adoptive mother Melinda and begin in the castle of your choice. Between levels, choose with the conductor Mak \u2014 from a random selection \u2014 which castle you want to advance to.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201780/extras/3848af47150af6523d061657a065e752.avif?t=1755109949\" width=616 height=48 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201780/extras/0af9798672b9e235bf5666ddd25dd9ba.poster.avif?t=1755109949\" width=616 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201780/extras/0af9798672b9e235bf5666ddd25dd9ba.webm?t=1755109949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201780/extras/0af9798672b9e235bf5666ddd25dd9ba.mp4?t=1755109949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Face a total of five intense and challenging boss battles against the kings or queens of each castle.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3201780?t=1755109949",